  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>When you take damage from a target within Close range, force the target to make a Reaction Roll (14). On a failure, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to deal them <strong>d6+2</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Once per rest, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to shroud yourself in negative energy until you take Severe damage or the scene ends. When an adversary within Melee range deals damage to you, they take <strong>1d10</strong> energy damage. <strong>Spend a Hope</strong> to let the negative energy reach out to an adversary up to Close range instead of Melee.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you successfully use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
